            "typeName": "dataSources",
            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "The DFS is a data collection effort made from June 2014 until August 2014 to enrich the Dutch part of the data collected in the “Children of Immigrant Longitudinal Survey in Four European Countries” (CILS4EU) (Kalter et al., 2013) and the “Children of Immigrant Longitudinal Survey in the Netherlands” (CILSNL; Van Tubergen & Jaspers, 2013). Hence, the source on which the data have been based are the participants in these surveys."
